- Root-cause fixes only, no mitigations.
- No boot experiments (P16 parked). No N-boot variance characterization.
- Current shipped config is baseline: EXO_DSV4_LMHEAD_MXFP8=1, EXACT_TOPK_PREFILL=1, QUERY_TILED_SDPA=1, VERIFY_BATCH=1 (+ start_cluster.sh defaults).
- NOT-FUNDED items (further head sharding, rowseq-GEMM custom kernels, tree drafting, context caps) must not be re-proposed.
- User owns exo/mlx-lm/mlx forks + both machines; code changes on the table.
