- Tests: 4 new tests in `tests/test_batch_pooling_cache_overlap.py` covering extend-widen with carry preservation, filter-narrow with width below construction width, filter index-order preservation (carry follows stream, not row), and the None-carry/extend path.

**2. Scope — PASS.** Commit touches only `mlx_lm/models/cache.py` (+60) and `tests/test_batch_pooling_cache_overlap.py` (+154). Zero occurrences of `EXO_DSV4_QUERY_TILED_SDPA`, `EXO_DSV4_EXACT_TOPK_PREFILL`, `EXO_HC_SINKHORN_ITERS`, or any `EXO_` string in the diff. No behavioral change on the unused path (all new code is additive; fetch's guard only fires on an already-broken state).

